    "body": "I noticed that Gatsby's websites (gatsbyjs.org and gatsbyjs.com) save cookies without user consent – like `GA`.\r\n\r\nThere is no cookie banner to allow user consent and I see no privacy policy.\r\n\r\nThe component [react-cookie-consent](https://www.npmjs.com/package/react-cookie-consent) could help with that. But as I can see, it has no way for a user to revoke consent later except for deleting the consent cookie manually or wait till the expiration time.\r\n\r\nI think Gatsby could need documentation and best practices about this topic. Maybe an official component or plugin that handles GDPR.",
